                                "sense_id": "fc186df4-2e78-3c09-93d7-55cac3736c32",
                                "text": "1923: George Bernard Shaw, The Perfect Wagnerite - Finally, Mozart's most dramatic finales and concerted numbers are more or less in sonata form, like symphonic movements, and must therefore be classed as musical prose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1a8ca43-f7ad-44b1-b024-0e9df5548bb3",
                                "sense_id": "fc186df4-2e78-3c09-93d7-55cac3736c32",
                                "text": "She enjoyed the rich symphonic sound of the concert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0ec5f5a-a7d5-4e7e-9062-6b371bbafe54",
                                "sense_id": "fc186df4-2e78-3c09-93d7-55cac3736c32",
                                "text": "The band incorporated symphonic elements into their rock music."
